  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-26T21:11:20.201Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Terrain Detail Meshes are essentially terrain grass but meshes instead, and get the same waving effect. Worlds uploaded with 2018 still have them in tact in 2019, but they are not carried over by the 2019 SDK, so they appear to be lost during upload.\n\nUPDATE:\nIt seems that some pack I had overwrote one of Unity's default shaders, and despite deleting that pack things were still broken. My understanding is that if the shader is imported as an actual separate shader things would work fine, but since it was directly conflicting with one of Unity's built-in shaders then everything went to crap, even *with* it having been deleted.",
